invalid type: string "Spectators providing advice may be barred from the tournament venue if the\nadvice was given maliciously or knowingly.\n\nIt is not outside assistance to receive strategic advice from a teammate in the 2v2\nformat or in other team formats when specified.\n\nAt a judge's discretion, a player may receive assistance with the physical logistics\ng player's main\nrding\ning.\n\nÿÿ